<title>USA: Elamex names Carlos Martens CFO.</title>
<headline>Elamex names Carlos Martens CFO.</headline>
<dateline>EL PASO, Texas 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elamex SA De CV said Monday that it had hired Carlos Martens, a former executive at Grupo Empresarial G SA, as its chief financial officer, effective immediately.</p>
<p>The position had been vacant since August, when former chief financial officer Salvador Almeida left to take a position with Coca-Cola Co, a spokeswoman for Elamex said.  </p>
<p>Elamex said Martens had been executive vice president for corporate planning and finance at Grupo Empresarial before joining Elamex.</p>
</text>
